# Cursor Rules for Adres Hız Sorgulama Project

## Project Overview
This is a Next.js project for querying internet speed at Turkish addresses. The project uses:
- Next.js 15+ (latest)
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui components
- Bun package manager

## Design System Rules
Follow the comprehensive design system specification provided by the user:
- Clarity over Ornamentation: Minimalist and functional design
- Content-First: UI should be unobtrusive canvas for content
- Speed as a Feature: Fast interactions (150-200ms animations)
- Keyboard-Driven: Full keyboard navigation support
- High-Density & Information-Rich: Accommodate large amounts of information

## Global Design Tokens
Use these design tokens consistently:

### Colors
- `--bg-primary: rgb(255, 255, 255)` - Primary app background
- `--bg-secondary: rgb(247, 247, 245)` - Sidebars, secondary panels
- `--bg-tertiary: rgb(242, 241, 238)` - Hover states, subtle backgrounds
- `--bg-inset: rgba(242, 241, 238, 0.6)` - Input backgrounds
- `--text-primary: rgb(50, 48, 44)` - Main text, headings
- `--text-secondary: rgb(115, 114, 110)` - Sub-headings, descriptions
- `--text-tertiary: rgba(71, 70, 68, 0.6)` - Placeholders, disabled text
- `--border-default: rgba(55, 53, 47, 0.09)` - Standard dividers
- `--border-input: rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.1)` - Input borders
- `--border-focus: rgb(35, 131, 226)` - Focus rings
- `--accent-primary: rgb(35, 131, 226)` - Primary buttons, selected items
- `--accent-primary-hover: rgba(35, 131, 226, 0.9)` - Primary hover states

### Typography
- Font Stack: `ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, "system-ui", ...` for UI
- Font Sizes: Use design system scale (h1: 32px, h2: 28px, h3: 24px, body: 16px, ui: 14px, caption: 12px)
- Font Weights: 400 (normal), 500 (medium), 600 (semibold)

### Spacing (8px Grid)
- `--space-1: 4px`, `--space-2: 8px`, `--space-3: 12px`, `--space-4: 16px`, `--space-6: 24px`, `--space-8: 32px`, `--space-12: 48px`

### Borders & Shadows
- Border Radius: `--radius-sm: 4px`, `--radius-md: 6px`, `--radius-lg: 10px`
- Box Shadows: Use `--shadow-sm` and `--shadow-md` tokens

## Component Guidelines
- Use shadcn/ui components as base
- Follow the design system component specifications
- Implement proper accessibility (ARIA roles, keyboard navigation)
- Use semantic HTML elements
- Ensure proper focus management

## Development Rules
- Use Bun as package manager exclusively
- Follow TypeScript best practices
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling
- Implement SPA (Single Page Application) design
- Use mock APIs for development
- Ensure responsive design
- Follow Turkish language requirements for UI text

## File Structure
- Use `src/` directory structure
- Components in `src/components/`
- Pages in `src/app/`
- Utils in `src/lib/`
- Types in `src/types/`

## API Integration
- Use mock APIs for development
- Implement proper error handling
- Use loading states
- Handle address validation
- Support both Google Maps API and direct API integration

## Accessibility Requirements
- Semantic HTML structure
- Keyboard navigation support
- ARIA roles and attributes
- Focus management
- Color contrast compliance (WCAG AA)
- Screen reader support

## Performance
- Fast loading times
- Optimized images
- Efficient state management
- Minimal bundle size
- Fast API responses

## Deployment
- Vercel deployment ready
- Railway deployment support
- Environment variable configuration
- Production optimizations
